      "end_time": 14.725,
      "transcript": "ਗਉੜੀ ਮਹਲਾ ਪੰਜਵਾ"
    },
    {
      "section_id": "section-00002",
      "start_time": 35.72,
      "end_time": 43.085,
      "transcript": "ਐਸੋ ਪਰਚਉ, ਪਾਇਓ"
    },
    {
      "section_id": "section-00003",
      "start_time": 43.88,
      "end_time": 51.045,
      "transcript": "ਕਰੀ ਕ੍ਰਿਪਾ ਦਇਆਲ ਬੀਠੁਲੈ"
    },
    {
      "section_id": "section-00004",
      "start_time": 51.76,
      "end_time": 59.405,
      "transcript": "ਸਤਿਗੁਰ ਮੁਝਹਿ ਬਤਾਇਓ ਰਹਾਉ"
    },
    {
      "section_id": "section-00005",
      "start_time": 67.405,
      "end_time": 74.695,
      "transcript": "ਜਤ ਕਤ ਦੇਖਉ ਤਤ ਤਤ ਤੁਮ ਹੀ"
    },
    {
      "section_id": "section-00006",
      "start_time": 75.24,
      "end_time": 82.375,
      "transcript": "ਮੋਹਿ ਇਹੁ ਬਿਸੁਆਸੁ ਹੋਇ ਆਇਓ"
    },
    {
      "section_id": "section-00007",
      "start_time": 83.2,
      "end_time": 90.145,
      "transcript": "ਕੈ ਪਹਿ ਕਰਉ ਅਰਦਾਸਿ ਬੇਨਤੀ"
    },
    {
      "section_id": "section-00008",
      "start_time": 90.96,
      "end_time": 97.975,
      "transcript": "ਜਉ ਸੁਨਤੋ ਹੈ ਰਘੁਰਾਇਓ"
    },
    {
      "section_id": "section-00009",
      "start_time": 98.635,
      "end_time": 105.705,
      "transcript": "ਲਹਿਓ ਸਹਸਾ ਬੰਧਨ ਗੁਰਿ ਤੋਰੇ"
    },
    {
      "section_id": "section-00010",
      "start_time": 106.52,
      "end_time": 113.475,
      "transcript": "ਤਾਂ ਸਦਾ ਸਹਜ ਸੁਖੁ ਪਾਇਓ"
    },
    {
      "section_id": "section-00011",
      "start_time": 114.28,
      "end_time": 121.335,
      "transcript": "ਹੋਣਾ ਸਾ ਸੋਈ ਫੁਨਿ ਹੋਸੀ"
    },
    {
      "section_id": "section-00012",
      "start_time": 122.0,
      "end_time": 129.215,
      "transcript": "ਸੁਖੁ ਦੁਖੁ ਕਹਾ ਦਿਖਾਇਓ"
    },
    {
      "section_id": "section-00013",
      "start_time": 129.92,
      "end_time": 137.105,
      "transcript": "ਖੰਡ ਬ੍ਰਹਮੰਡ ਕਾ ਏਕੋ ਠਾਣਾ"
    },
    {
      "section_id": "section-00014",
      "start_time": 137.68,
      "end_time": 144.905,
      "transcript": "ਗੁਰਿ ਪਰਦਾ ਖੋਲਿ ਦਿਖਾਇਓ"
    },
    {
      "section_id": "section-00015",
      "start_time": 145.52,
      "end_time": 152.715,
      "transcript": "ਨਉ ਨਿਧਿ ਨਾਮੁ ਨਿਧਾਨੁ ਇਕ ਠਾਈ"
    },
    {
      "section_id": "section-00016",
      "start_time": 153.36,
      "end_time": 160.615,
      "transcript": "ਤਉ ਬਾਹਰਿ ਕੈਠੈ ਜਾਇਓ"
    },
    {
      "section_id": "section-00017",
      "start_time": 161.24,
      "end_time": 168.395,
      "transcript": "ਏਕੈ ਕਨਿਕ ਅਨਿਕ ਭਾਤਿ ਸਾਜੀ"
    },
    {
      "section_id": "section-00018",
      "start_time": 169.08,
      "end_time": 176.165,
      "transcript": "ਬਹੁ ਪਰਕਾਰ ਰਚਾਇਓ"
    },
    {
      "section_id": "section-00019",
      "start_time": 176.775,
      "end_time": 184.145,
      "transcript": "ਕਹੁ ਨਾਨਕ ਭਰਮੁ ਗੁਰਿ ਖੋਈ ਹੈ"
    },
    {
      "section_id": "section-00020",
      "start_time": 184.6,
      "end_time": 191.535,
      "transcript": "ਇਵ ਤਤੈ ਤਤੁ ਮਿਲਾਇਓ"
